  ('bohemian', 2, 'bohemian fashion', 'She loves to wear bohemian fashion, which features vibrant colors and unique patterns.', '她喜欢穿波希米亚风格的服装，特色是鲜艳的颜色和独特的图案。', 'daily_life'),
  ('bohemian', 3, 'bohemian artists', 'Many bohemian artists have influenced modern art movements with their radical ideas.', '许多波希米亚艺术家以其激进的思想影响了现代艺术运动。', 'academic'),
